[00:20.769]Show that you're scared like me
{"展现你和我一样的恐惧"}
[00:22.999]Thus we are teens
{"因此我们都是少年"}
[00:23.780]Wash my hands of that for this?
{"为此洗手不干？"}
[00:25.950]Sell myself for this hopeless loop
{"为这无望循环出卖自我"}
[00:32.891]May I have seen your face somewhere sometime?
{"我是否曾在某时某地见过你的面容？"}
[00:36.922]You freeze my blood and spine
{"你令我血液凝固脊背发寒"}
[00:38.208]So freak me out
{"所以吓唬我吧"}
[00:39.801]Like a look in a mirror
